 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Stars for «في السماء بروجا» (gone before «وحفظناها»). The devils and the shooting flame (17-18) are never drawn. 18 keeps «إلا من استرق السمع» whole in one chip, framed as «في بعض الأوقات». Mountain, growth and wheat for 19-20. Geometric for «عندنا خزائنه», nothing on the negated «لستم له برازقين». 21 keeps «إن… إلا» and «ما… إلا» whole. No first-person paraphrase (Al-Muyassar's «أنا جعلنا» is not used). STAGING v4: 16: a traveller in the desert at night looks up at the stars (As-Sa'di: stars guide in the darkness of land and sea; Al-Muyassar: for those who look at them). 17-18 (devils, the shooting flame: the unseen) stay ambient as they were. 19-20: fields; the growth event on 19:6, a mountain plate on 19:5, a man in the fields and wheat on 20:4 (tillage), a camel enters on 20:5 (both tafsirs: livestock and beasts that people do not feed). 21: geometric on 21:5 (His treasuries); rain on the fields from 21:8 (As-Sa'di: what is sent down in measure, rain and other things), a rain cloud plate on 21:10."
 },
